            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Shop Lawn and Garden Tools in Colorado – Trusted Since 1989",
            "text": "<p>Tired of trimming branches with dull tools that just don’t cut it? We get it—when you’re working in rocky soil, thick brush, or tall trees, you need the right tool for the job. That’s why we stock a wide range of reliable garden tools and pruning equipment made for Colorado yards and weather. </p><p>From<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Loppers\" target=\"_blank\"> loppers</a> and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hedge+Shears\" target=\"_blank\"> hedge shears</a> to<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Pruners\" target=\"_blank\"> tree pruners</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/striking-tools\" target=\"_blank\"> striking tools</a>, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/long-handle-tools\" target=\"_blank\"> long handle tools</a>, we’ve got gear built for real work and lasting performance. Rivendell Distribution carries both classic garden hand tools and modern electric options, so you can shape, trim, and maintain your garden or property with less effort and better results.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
